      ['medir', 'Judgement and honesty', 'If something makes no sense, we say so. We deliver results you can measure.'],
    ],
    culturaE: '03 · Culture',
    cultura: 'AI augments teams, it does not replace them.',
    culturaP: 'We work with agents every day. That is why we look for people who can direct them, review them and decide better than they do.',
